-          * submissions at all and no draw state can render; if it does, the draw stream is what
-          * stalls it. */
-         if (ok2) {
+         /* Firmware liveness check: a render whose control stream is only a STREAM_TERMINATE. It
+          * must complete before anything else can be trusted; keep it behind the diagnostic switch
+          * because it runs AFTER the draw (a terminating-only TA job is a guess at a minimal job,
